# Two defaults of the SAME rank that disagree are a conflict, not a
# quiet pick: [aontu/pref_rank_clash], whose hint names the fix --
# rank one of them (ADR-011 R2; it read [aontu/scalar_value] before,
# the code of a conflict between the VALUES rather than between the
# defaults holding them).  This is why
# each layer of the stack owns one rank -- two teams' files both using
# * would collide exactly like this.

level: *info | string
level: *debug | string
